*.rpm

# Local credentials and signing material, never portable project knowledge.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
**/key.properties
**/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
*.mobileprovision
